Barnaby was not your average house cat. While his siblings spent their days napping in sunbeams and their nights chasing laser pointers, Barnaby spent his time staring intently at the sliding glass door, his tail twitching with a rhythm that suggested he was calculating the trajectory of a squirrel three trees away.

